L268: _Received: 13 April 2010 / Published: 13 April 2010_
L269: We have found an error in our manuscript published in _Nutrients_ [1]. On page 322 in the methods (section
L270: 2.5) it states ‘0.36 mg’ of pycnogenol is contained in one dose of the lactaway (antioxidant) supplement. This
L271: should in fact read ‘36 mg’ of pycnogenol. This is purely a typographical error and does not impact on the
L272: results or conclusions drawn from this work. However we do apologise for any inconvenience caused to the
L273: readers.
